# --- Secrets: Claude auth (OAuth token or API key) ---
# Template: vault-research.env.example
*.env
!*.env.example

# --- LiveSync CLI: local DB + settings (CouchDB URL, user, password, E2EE passphrase) ---
# Docs: docs/livesync-cli-settings.md
livesync-db/
.livesync/
**/settings.json

# --- Watcher runtime state (your research history and dedupe index) ---
state/
state.json
work/

# --- Personal vault content ---
# Template: templates/Lab Profile.example.md
Lab Profile.md
Research Queue.md
Research/
vault/

# --- Temp / Python ---
.*.tmp
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
